.env
.env.*
logs/
*.log
node_modules/
.claude/state/

# ── PACK WORKSPACES (R-SP-1 / P2a) — THIS REPO IS PUBLIC ────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything a pack READS and everything it WRITES is runtime, never tracked. The operator exports
# real internal documents into inbox/; the pack normalises them into work/ and writes proposals,
# drafts and routing lines into out/. None of that may ever reach a public remote.
#
# Globbed on the pack ROOT rather than enumerated per pack: a second pack must inherit the same
# protection on the day it is created, not on the day someone remembers to add three lines. The
# enumeration would be the drift QR-DG-4 recorded and C-26 repeated.
#
# Machinery is tracked by EXCEPTION below — instructions, the standards checklist, templates. If a
# path is not explicitly re-included here it does not ship, which is the safe default direction.
.claude/skills/packs/*/inbox/
.claude/skills/packs/*/work/
.claude/skills/packs/*/out/
logs/pack-*.jsonl
